@SeasonId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Rosters of a season, by name (take the id from GET /seasons; defaults: offset 0, limit 25)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/rosters
Accept: application/json

### Page through the rosters
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/rosters?offset=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Search by words of the name: any order, case and diacritics ignored
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/rosters?q=jastrzebski wegiel
Accept: application/json

### Descending by name
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/rosters?sort=-name
Accept: application/json

### Error: the season does not exist (404, unlike GET /rosters?seasonId= which returns an empty list)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/rosters
Accept: application/json

### Error: the season id is not a GUID (404, the route does not match)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/not-a-guid/rosters
Accept: application/json

### Error: unknown sort field (400, errors.sort)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/rosters?sort=city
Accept: application/json

### Error: limit above the maximum of 100 (400, errors.limit)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/rosters?limit=1000
Accept: application/json

### Error: negative offset (400, errors.offset)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/rosters?offset=-1
Accept: application/json
